# Product parameter defaults for TBS_LUCID_H7_PROD.
# Lines ending in @READONLY are locked: the GCS cannot change them and the
# value is enforced on every boot regardless of stored parameters.
#
# NOTE: calibration parameters (INS_ACC*, COMPASS_OFS*, RC*_MIN/MAX/TRIM,
# battery ampere-offsets) must stay writable or factory calibration and
# per-unit setup will break. Never mark those @READONLY.

# ---- replicated from stock TBS_LUCID_H7 defaults.parm ----
SERVO13_FUNCTION 120
RELAY3_DEFAULT 1
RELAY4_DEFAULT 1
RELAY2_DEFAULT 1
OSD_TYPE2 5

# ---- product configuration locks ----
# airframe is a quadcopter, not user-changeable
FRAME_CLASS 1 @READONLY

# VTX control: IRC Tramp on SERIAL1, always enabled
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 44 @READONLY
VTX_ENABLE 1 @READONLY
VTX_MAX_POWER 10000 @READONLY

# ---- tuning locks: fill in after flight tuning is finalized ----
# Copy the tuned values here and append @READONLY, e.g.:
# ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.135 @READONLY
# ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.135 @READONLY
# ATC_RAT_RLL_D 0.0036 @READONLY
# ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.135 @READONLY
# ATC_RAT_YAW_P 0.18 @READONLY
# ATC_ANG_RLL_P 4.5 @READONLY
# INS_GYRO_FILTER 40 @READONLY
# MOT_THST_EXPO 0.65 @READONLY
# MOT_SPIN_MIN 0.15 @READONLY
# MOT_SPIN_ARM 0.10 @READONLY
